{"feed":{"entry":[{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom","xmlns$blogger":"http://schemas.google.com/blogger/2008","xmlns$georss":"http://www.georss.org/georss","xmlns$gd":"http://schemas.google.com/g/2005","xmlns$thr":"http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0","id":{"$t":"tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-6818054921907446479.post-2667798292850386536"},"published":{"$t":"2018-09-10T00:17:00.003+02:00"},"updated":{"$t":"2018-09-10T00:17:49.938+02:00"},"title":{"type":"text","$t":"Socha a tabuľa na Orgoňovej Kýčere"},"content":{"type":"html","$t":"<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\nV sobotu 1.9.2018 sa naše združenie zúčastnilo akcie - slávnostného odhalenia drevenej sochy Starého Orgoňa na Orgoňovej Kýčere - jedného z najvyšších vrchov v pohorí Javorníky. Nachádza sa na pomedzí Dolnej/Hornej Marikovej a je s ním spojená pekná povesť o tajomnom Orgoňovi - poslednom pohanskom žrecovi v Javorníkoch, ktorý v stredoveku až do svojho záhadného konca odmietal prijať nové náboženstvo - kresťanstvo a zostal verný starým pohanským bohom.&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjNP7d-Lv8BLwwEb9SzOSeK0yp7FoUFHxQ77JmQBmryX5qBox0t4-em35pJkGV9RdjMSM6cJDotJqB2rQ5vaXAVwFg8WmjhFAMRxyLyYcEvlKOd-N86M2YPpCFVuGS9rHZWq3ev5yc06oFp/s1600/40642799_313292122554699_719461903172108288_n.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"960\" data-original-width=\"720\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjNP7d-Lv8BLwwEb9SzOSeK0yp7FoUFHxQ77JmQBmryX5qBox0t4-em35pJkGV9RdjMSM6cJDotJqB2rQ5vaXAVwFg8WmjhFAMRxyLyYcEvlKOd-N86M2YPpCFVuGS9rHZWq3ev5yc06oFp/s320/40642799_313292122554699_719461903172108288_n.jpg\" width=\"240\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEix2RTKYMZi_LEcDxt0JeErQv0fmxgYeJmgTDJwqS_POf3P7fqF6cCoOS22WXcx6ZS2HKpyFaenYULM_BBbsXdJWbMBNHsJnRaqx7cvy2BcP0vXNJPIzr7jJvIr2xOKu009la85ljsv8Jm3/s1600/40589323_313292029221375_5516970115452633088_n.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"960\" data-original-width=\"720\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEix2RTKYMZi_LEcDxt0JeErQv0fmxgYeJmgTDJwqS_POf3P7fqF6cCoOS22WXcx6ZS2HKpyFaenYULM_BBbsXdJWbMBNHsJnRaqx7cvy2BcP0vXNJPIzr7jJvIr2xOKu009la85ljsv8Jm3/s320/40589323_313292029221375_5516970115452633088_n.jpg\" width=\"240\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhitbTrohYfz7ezLkX9u4N-i6AdR2AynEWmKAz3G3TxVqd89frqKO7baXjN5eyKDVb7eqGYgcq6MruEmzMMtQdnZFyYTLnCxpP9ba3GnpdkP8F16zaLRhtLyeWvtxBARFXrAHp06btMifW0/s1600/Orgonova_kycera_tabula_lowres.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1129\" data-original-width=\"1600\" height=\"225\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhitbTrohYfz7ezLkX9u4N-i6AdR2AynEWmKAz3G3TxVqd89frqKO7baXjN5eyKDVb7eqGYgcq6MruEmzMMtQdnZFyYTLnCxpP9ba3GnpdkP8F16zaLRhtLyeWvtxBARFXrAHp06btMifW0/s320/Orgonova_kycera_tabula_lowres.jpg\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\nAutorom sochy je nadaný rezbár Vladimír Ragula z Hatného. Celú akciu zorganizoval starosta Hornej Marikovej pán Miroslav Hamár. Okrem odhalenia 3 metrovej sochy bola na Kýčere osadená aj nová informačná tabuľa,&nbsp; ktorá obsahuje prepísanú povesť od Štefana Meliša a Stanislava Muntága o Starom Orgoňovi. Tabuľu vytvorilo naše Občianske združenie Hradiská.&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiZozKrLlPYt53KOoQKOWECvQ86RPNXuQN3E4Vf-fOFkEuxandhpBf-C5LmJ_ivHF5UPJM9gdMtOMO7shRmwzuC7OyWcJ9gsihyphenhyphenek7cYiZeDaHTMwoVNAJifKE2n4TmLGsrWdD2YrfOmmVB/s1600/40756453_313291832554728_2045862849170898944_n.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"720\" data-original-width=\"960\" height=\"240\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiZozKrLlPYt53KOoQKOWECvQ86RPNXuQN3E4Vf-fOFkEuxandhpBf-C5LmJ_ivHF5UPJM9gdMtOMO7shRmwzuC7OyWcJ9gsihyphenhyphenek7cYiZeDaHTMwoVNAJifKE2n4TmLGsrWdD2YrfOmmVB/s320/40756453_313291832554728_2045862849170898944_n.jpg\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjGGi87jZP6Teotrxovnolx-P9YBMk8u3t_f290GmdfScoau8SKl5dterizi7qBmqH53CYr9p75KUE0jUvnZhpnKS_RzEcPCBFFZ0pWBi0r7NoMX-q8LALh0wO6TrPXTAghkXi1mpqyB8VZ/s1600/40592174_313291785888066_8832017554600886272_n.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"720\" data-original-width=\"960\" height=\"240\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjGGi87jZP6Teotrxovnolx-P9YBMk8u3t_f290GmdfScoau8SKl5dterizi7qBmqH53CYr9p75KUE0jUvnZhpnKS_RzEcPCBFFZ0pWBi0r7NoMX-q8LALh0wO6TrPXTAghkXi1mpqyB8VZ/s320/40592174_313291785888066_8832017554600886272_n.jpg\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhTA5zZuwV2s3oBBfVQNT-jNLImpbqnX77XeWZszE0TI066lNqh6AKZDCkxLPBfLksj8mIi40SLZ1aZeeCvmtVTc1PFs4NQJjINI_LT5vnuTpPXc976MCc7gb_8mBALQ5RlCyY4h2Y_jC7B/s1600/40656459_313291869221391_3642531617362149376_n.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"960\" data-original-width=\"720\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhTA5zZuwV2s3oBBfVQNT-jNLImpbqnX77XeWZszE0TI066lNqh6AKZDCkxLPBfLksj8mIi40SLZ1aZeeCvmtVTc1PFs4NQJjINI_LT5vnuTpPXc976MCc7gb_8mBALQ5RlCyY4h2Y_jC7B/s320/40656459_313291869221391_3642531617362149376_n.jpg\" width=\"240\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEipUWAjIUVWD8d6fsBJRitDaGQoXApJBytDqn18XA7DHV5ItMFiFDpoCpnLePRl7YgJvMRScKU1SnKTgOskztLeqBx4uU0Qs0mfyIaOdHPaGjvb8xR-B0VwZ71q-ISHvOM3tmVyemka_Tym/s1600/DSC00549.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"900\" data-original-width=\"1600\" height=\"179\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEipUWAjIUVWD8d6fsBJRitDaGQoXApJBytDqn18XA7DHV5ItMFiFDpoCpnLePRl7YgJvMRScKU1SnKTgOskztLeqBx4uU0Qs0mfyIaOdHPaGjvb8xR-B0VwZ71q-ISHvOM3tmVyemka_Tym/s320/DSC00549.JPG\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjaVpLDC1e2Aqbu79v2HbrdSgP0MQQAsCSwPYQ6xD8dmzm4Sr8vzQmfQ8ybdfjW_gs3gHzBx05Sp2ENKKDj175B8Bie60DFCJEqEt7xAqzYHR_ifaFL-8wLzvEDa26ZtWukCsktL_2WmLvc/s1600/DSC00570.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"900\" data-original-width=\"1600\" height=\"179\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjaVpLDC1e2Aqbu79v2HbrdSgP0MQQAsCSwPYQ6xD8dmzm4Sr8vzQmfQ8ybdfjW_gs3gHzBx05Sp2ENKKDj175B8Bie60DFCJEqEt7xAqzYHR_ifaFL-8wLzvEDa26ZtWukCsktL_2WmLvc/s320/DSC00570.JPG\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgMWDWxpbTg1mUU6OC-gj-HT5DH5f9ecVOaFcFyDzIsUX8XXt7LcUA98IVODJpYYkET9u5WsN7PkH3avriJUAC4InUbXMWynBXMEMVRXtYDzFTiLe1YEFs7IFQJ2Hiq0_dANQB66b6oMunb/s1600/40657888_313291912554720_2112476481966833664_n.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"960\" data-original-width=\"720\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgMWDWxpbTg1mUU6OC-gj-HT5DH5f9ecVOaFcFyDzIsUX8XXt7LcUA98IVODJpYYkET9u5WsN7PkH3avriJUAC4InUbXMWynBXMEMVRXtYDzFTiLe1YEFs7IFQJ2Hiq0_dANQB66b6oMunb/s320/40657888_313291912554720_2112476481966833664_n.jpg\" width=\"240\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhs4_sNiroDoOH32ORWB8cFKyJ8GgI9MZ4TmbJJdgX9HOboZZMjuEP1T6U3FzwjmXlSi9jbvvfaEmJS0nuXQDdzWvaXA0RevCqRQEwOUQkDtZi5VTVYVTG9Au5OrM6nXQEJd-wKRPU8i7vL/s1600/40603775_313291992554712_1817193756630188032_n.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"720\" data-original-width=\"960\" height=\"240\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhs4_sNiroDoOH32ORWB8cFKyJ8GgI9MZ4TmbJJdgX9HOboZZMjuEP1T6U3FzwjmXlSi9jbvvfaEmJS0nuXQDdzWvaXA0RevCqRQEwOUQkDtZi5VTVYVTG9Au5OrM6nXQEJd-wKRPU8i7vL/s320/40603775_313291992554712_1817193756630188032_n.jpg\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\nSamotná akcia na Kýčere bola skvele zorganizovaná, za čo patrí vďaka pánovi starostovi Hornej Marikovej. Čapované chladené pivo a výborný poľovnícky guláš spríjemnili celú akciu ľuďom, ktorí sa tu zhromaždili naozaj v hojnom počte. Zostáva len držať Starému Orgoňovi palce, aby Kýčeru strážil najbližšie desaťročia a aby nepadol za obeť prírodným, ani zlým ľudským silám.</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\nOrgoň</div>\n"},"link":[{"rel":"replies","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"http://www.hradiska.sk/feeds/2667798292850386536/comments/default","title":"Zverejniť komentáre"},{"rel":"replies","type":"text/html","href":"http://www.hradiska.sk/2018/09/socha-tabula-na-orgonovej-kycere.html#comment-form","title":"0 komentárov"},{"rel":"edit","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"http://www.blogger.com/feeds/6818054921907446479/posts/default/2667798292850386536"},{"rel":"self","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"http://www.blogger.com/feeds/6818054921907446479/posts/default/2667798292850386536"},{"rel":"alternate","type":"text/html","href":"http://www.hradiska.sk/2018/09/socha-tabula-na-orgonovej-kycere.html","title":"Socha a tabuľa na Orgoňovej Kýčere"}],"author":[{"name":{"$t":"Orgon"},"uri":{"$t":"http://www.blogger.com/profile/01396912608531297025"},"email":{"$t":"noreply@blogger.com"},"gd$image":{"rel":"http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail","width":"32","height":"32","src":"//blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjRf79q2mlg3o6hsyWbYMCCgv1WaA6pM0mtkWB0QdJ76W64emXoS0lwpSlUw9K5iinuoAVrX4RwIXY0RoOkY_QRl8Yy2oMkJAodsY_W7_GnMHXspVw3fuuBpiYA7JlSOlY/s220/SH+Kruh+s+dlznom1.JPG"}}],"media$thumbnail":{"xmlns$media":"http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/","url":"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjNP7d-Lv8BLwwEb9SzOSeK0yp7FoUFHxQ77JmQBmryX5qBox0t4-em35pJkGV9RdjMSM6cJDotJqB2rQ5vaXAVwFg8WmjhFAMRxyLyYcEvlKOd-N86M2YPpCFVuGS9rHZWq3ev5yc06oFp/s72-c/40642799_313292122554699_719461903172108288_n.jpg","height":"72","width":"72"},"thr$total":{"$t":"0"}}]}}